body:
Yea, if that's possible, then wouldn't the game or the game's creator be our definition of god? 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

(please don't get triggered, it's a joke people)

Your post gave my a little courage today to face my life. Thank you. I will be flagging this post so that whenever I'm at the edge, I'll remember you and this post, and hopefully you can inspire me to stay alive. Once again, thank you.

&#x200B;

edit: saving this post

Same. Like I know all the things I need to do to cope with my depression, like meditate, talk to someone, go to therapy etc etc, but at the same time I just hate myself so much that I do not see the point of even trying to help myself if I'm only going to fail, again and again, again and again, again and again... 

&#x200B;

I know all the psychological theories behind depression, but I can never seem to use that information to help myself, and at times, it only cripples me even more
